	(text "HDMI OUT from the module's HDMI 2.0 TX: the on-set monitor feed (captured frames, no encode).\nTMDS pairs 100 ohm differential.  5 V on pin 18 from a current-limited switch (HDMI requires >= 55 mA).\nDDC/HPD go straight to the module, which level-shifts them (Radxa CM3 datasheet 3.5.1).  CEC not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
